{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36615","headline":"淮南送李司空朝觐 · 罗隐","name":"淮南送李司空朝觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣君宵旰望时雍，丹诏西来雨露浓。\n宣父道高休叹凤，武侯才大本吟龙。\n九州似鼎终须负，万物爲铜只待熔。\n腊後春前更何事，便看经度奏东封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}